        "step_3": "Does paper describe foundational NLP tool/dataset/algorithm? If NO \u2192 EXCLUDE (no_nlp_focus)",
        "step_4": "Is tool development/evaluation central to paper? If NO \u2192 EXCLUDE (downstream_only)",
        "step_5": "Does paper fit year range (2016-2026)? If NO \u2192 EXCLUDE (out_of_date)",
